# A creature spell cast for its mutate cost has a target (CR 702.140a) and is still a creature spell with its card's mana value (CR 702.140b):
# with Jackal grown to power 4 (Elvish Mystic, Grizzly Bears, Alpine Grizzly each copied: 1 -> 4), Cubwarden (mana value 4) mutated onto Alpine Grizzly is copied.
# "Copy that spell" gives the copy the original's target and no chance to choose new ones (CR 707.10c), so no target prompt appears and the
# copy mutates onto one Alpine Grizzly (two Cats), then the original onto that merged creature, which now has the mutate trigger of both Cubwarden cards
# (CR 702.140e, 603.2): four more Cats, six in all. The other Alpine Grizzly is left alone, and Jackal gets his counter (5/5).

